<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foodland says Q1 sales down 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foodland says Q1 sales down 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grocery retailer and wholesaler Foodland Associated Ltd said on Thursday its sales fell 0.2 percent to A$876.68 million for the 13 weeks to October 27.  </p>
<p>The company, which controls the Progressive chain in New Zealand, said New Zealand sales rose by 0.2 percent to A$614.248 million from A$612.994 million in the year ago quarter.</p>
<p>Australian sales fell 1.2 percent to A$262.434 million from A$265.754 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
